2026-11-06T16:43:19.1138840Z [0m
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1139610Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1140000Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1140210Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1140430Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1140970Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1141210Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1141390Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1141820Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1142100Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1142470Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1143100Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1143720Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1144130Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1144330Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1144510Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1144740Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1144960Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1146130Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1146310Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1146580Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1146710Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1146980Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1147420Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1170270Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1170560Z I will:
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1170730Z 
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1171100Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1171860Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1172920Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1173340Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1173620Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1174180Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1174650Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1175200Z    /var/root
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1205730Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1206130Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1238920Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1239960Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1241040Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-06T16:43:19.1242740Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
